# Predictive Analytics Using Historical Data 📈

Forecasts future sales trends from historical time-series data using regression models, with train/test evaluation and a 30-day forward forecast.

## Features
- Cleans and preprocesses historical daily sales data
- Feature engineering: trend, day-of-week, month, cyclical (sin/cos) seasonality
- Compares Linear Regression vs Random Forest Regressor
- Evaluates accuracy: MAE, RMSE, R²
- Visualizes actual vs predicted sales, and a 30-day forward forecast

## Tech Stack
Python · Pandas · NumPy · scikit-learn · Matplotlib

