## Results
| Model             | MAE    | RMSE   | R²   |
|-------------------|--------|--------|------|
| Linear Regression | 109.55 | 135.92 | 0.87 |
| Random Forest     | 161.60 | 193.10 | 0.74 |

**Best model: Linear Regression** — captures the underlying trend + seasonality cleanly since the signal is largely linear/cyclical, while Random Forest slightly overfits noise on unseen future dates.

## Key Insights
- Sales show clear weekly and yearly seasonality on top of a steady upward trend
- Regression with cyclical (sin/cos) seasonal features outperforms tree-based models for extrapolation into the future
- Model forecasts the next 30 days with ~87% variance explained (R²)

